(108, NULL, NULL, 'created', 'App\\Models\\DocumentTemplate', 1, '[]', '{\"name\":\"barngay clearance\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<p><strong>TO&nbsp;WHOM&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;MAY&nbsp;CONCERN:<\\/strong><\\/p><p><\\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;certify&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;business&nbsp;or&nbsp;trade&nbsp;activity&nbsp;described&nbsp;below:<\\/p><p><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong><u>TRICYCLE\\/&nbsp;FRANCHISE<\\/u><\\/strong><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">(Business&nbsp;Name&nbsp;or&nbsp;Trade&nbsp;Activity)<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong><u>&nbsp;PUROK-6&nbsp;DUYAY,&nbsp;BOAC,&nbsp;MARINDUQUE<\\/u><\\/strong><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">(Location)<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong><u>{{&nbsp;resident.full_name&nbsp;}}<\\/u><\\/strong><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">(Operator\\/Manager)<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong><u>DUYAY,&nbsp;BOAC,&nbsp;MARINDUQUE<\\/u><\\/strong><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">(Address)<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">Propose&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;established&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;Barangay&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;being&nbsp;applied&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;Barangay&nbsp;Clearance&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;in&nbsp;securing&nbsp;a&nbsp;corresponding&nbsp;Barangay&nbsp;Permit&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;found&nbsp;to&nbsp;be:<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\"><\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">___\\/&nbsp;In&nbsp;conformity&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;provision&nbsp;of&nbsp;existing&nbsp;Barangay&nbsp;Ordinances,&nbsp;rules&nbsp;and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;regulations&nbsp;being&nbsp;enforced&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;barangay;<\\/p><p class=